The permutation flow shop instances in `taillard/` (ta001-ta120) are those of
E. Taillard, "Benchmarks for basic scheduling problems", European Journal of
Operational Research 64 (1993) 278-285. They are regenerated by
`scripts/gen_taillard_pfsp.py` from the generator and time seeds in the
OR-Library file flowshop2.txt (contributed by D.C. Mattfeld and R.J.M.
Vaessens), redistributed here under the MIT License of OR-Library.

